{"version":1,"content":"<p>台灣盛事「第61屆金鐘奬」一連兩天舉行，分為節目類及戲劇類頒奬，今晚（26日）戲劇類舉行頒獎禮，一眾女星悉心打扮到場，於紅地氈上爭妍鬥麗，憑參演《喝酒吧﹗笨蛋》入圍角逐女配角的王渝萱，選擇以一襲黑色緞面長晚裝登場，Deep V領口、腰側挖空</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T12:40:59.209646+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":120,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T11:56:40+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T12:38:11.467187+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T12:38:11.467187+00:00","content_hash":"de4d0d71f5f42e29839ae71ddd644b27698fe95c1d550b041972ca58e2d5b56e","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}